<h2><span class="mw-headline" id="Description">Description</span></h2>
<p>Determine whether oCreature has nAbilityID in their list of <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/Ability" title="Abilities">abilities</a>. See <a href="https://github.com/adarec1994/DragonAgeToolset/wiki/ABI%20base.xls" title="ABI base.xls">ABI base.xls</a> for a list of abilities.
